## Deviations

- The become-a-tutor block uses `next/image` on `productPictures.tutorSession`, not
  `SiteImageView`. `SiteImageView` needs a `SiteImage` with an 800w and a 1600w file, and this
  photo has one 1024px file, so its `srcSet` would advertise widths the file does not have.
  The `next/image` form is the pattern of the sibling product pages (primary, science,
  storytime, math, codecamp, stem, zhongwen). No new image component was added.
- The hero keeps `ProductPicture` and drops the `priority` hint. `next.config.ts` sets
  `images.unoptimized: true`, so one file ships either way.
- `build-graph` was not run. The brief's allowed commands do not include it, and no export,
  signature, or import edge changed.

